<Recipe>
  <Name>Green Apple Sorbet</Name>
  <Info>Cut granny smith, blend with acid water
Let hydrocolloids hydrate 2 to 4 hours
Churn</Info>
  <Rtf>{\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\nouicompat\deflang1053{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Microsoft Sans Serif;}{\f1\fnil Microsoft Sans Serif;}}
{\*\generator Riched20 10.0.22621}\viewkind4\uc1 
\pard\f0\fs24 Adaptation\par
Remove lemon juice\par
Replace with citric and malic acid and up water proportionally\par
Replace xanthan with CMC\f1\par
\f0 Apple brix 11\par
Mix brix 31\par
A bit foamy texture\par
Should we up the POD\f1\par
}
</Rtf>
